Package: causaliflower
Title: Build and Assess Causal Graphs
Version: 0.0.2.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan", "Moller", , "aidan.moller@adelaide.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Builds, edits and plots causal graphs in R to support causal
    analysis. Provides guided assessment of causal arrows and checks whether
    effects are identifiable under stated assumptions. Constructs directed
    acyclic graphs by querying a structural causal model derived from APSIM for
    barley, wheat and maize. Extends 'dagitty' and 'ggdag'.
